sequenceDiagram
  participant PA as Provider Adapter
  participant IN as Ingestion
  participant EQ as Evidence Qualification
  participant NG as Neo4j
  participant AS as UACRF Assess
  participant CT as OPA and UACRF Control
  participant HU as Human Approval
  participant RC as UACRF Recover
  participant VA as Validation
  participant EV as UACRF Evidence
  PA->>IN: Native signal inventory or change
  IN->>EQ: Canonical evidence envelope
  alt Evidence not qualified
    EQ->>EV: Quarantine record reason codes and digest
  else Evidence qualified
    EQ->>NG: Idempotent projection command
    NG->>NG: Reconcile topology and create graph revision
    NG-->>AS: Revision and action relevant subgraph digest
    AS->>NG: Bounded impact and recovery traversals
    NG-->>AS: Witness paths impacts SLOs and recovery paths
    AS->>CT: Candidate action qualified evidence and graph context
    CT->>CT: Deterministic policy evaluation
    opt Approval required
      CT->>HU: Bounded approval request
      HU-->>CT: Approve reject or expire
    end
    CT->>RC: Signed audience bound expiring authorization
    RC->>PA: Provider neutral intent and idempotency key
    PA-->>RC: Provider result
    RC->>VA: Execution result and ordered validation plan
    VA->>PA: Read post action signals
    PA-->>VA: Validation observations
    alt Mandatory check fails
      VA->>RC: Compensate stop or escalate
    else Checks pass for stable window
      VA->>EV: Validated result and recovered outcome
    end
    RC->>EV: Execution record
    CT->>EV: Policy authorization and approval evidence
    EV->>EV: Seal DecisionEnvelope and replay index
  end
